### ==========================================
### 用户 User CRUD
### ==========================================

### 获取所有用户
GET http://localhost:3205/api/users?fields=*

### 获取所有用户
GET http://localhost:3205/api/users

### 获取单个用户
GET http://localhost:3205/api/users/1

### 创建用户
POST http://localhost:3205/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "张三",
    "password": "123456",
    "position": "东塔台",
    "roleType": "",
    "status": 1,
    "team": 1,
    "rank": 1
}

### 更新用户
PUT http://localhost:3205/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "position": "西塔台",
    "status": 1
}

### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:3205/api/users/1
